<description>&lt;p&gt;The Myanmar junta continues its campaign of violence, prompting the International Court of Justice to rule that Myanmar committed genocide against the Rohingya. Malaysia is repatriating another 6,803 Myanmar nationals despite the genocide ruling, as its prime minister acknowledges the junta’s atrocities. The U.K. has sanctioned five senior Myanmar military officials in response to the court’s decision. The conflict remains deadly, with 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/24/malaysia-to-send-thousands-of-migrants-back-to-myanmar&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/news/audio/2026/nov/24/myanmar-found-guilty-genocide-should-israel-be-worried-podcast&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNM0Fta1BkcGNCQ3ZRMmRYZ055QmhtMjNuQW83d0hUbWJEOGo3SmloTmdENnZmdFQwS0ptVlRFWGFocS1BNGhSNm1xMGdPdEpSVnA1Z0FjY0YwTkVObnctcS01WXRleXlxZUJNRk1zYU9YNlZRcFZJNm1OcklnczhRbzBfc1ROeFJDSmxhMm9LOUNBeEtEd3p2NVlfamo?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQdjFkZ2JDbm9zS191dGVPU01XcElTSW1xNEVmbG5vbGRCZC1aaDhyRS1uazQ5bkFvZ2lvcVhWRGxxVTlYUTBpUUVtWktteTRSdFFkQ0R1cG5UdXQtUWVtTzF6UURfN0dzN3RvV0gtMVZ3Q2hPYmhRUVdlQWo0Z3VuMEI4LUZoMWZnaFZBMGxDekdyN2s?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxPc2g1ZFlkOUVKUkNtc2tfVzgzbmRfZEljdVRGY3FZMVRWY082YWZMRGFIM0pmRXVqT3lrd0F6SmRzVmxmRENsVnVQUm8wcl9nakVEMWdIeGNWbmd3OHFpbWdxcDEyWGprWGhMWlVxaFFfdFJBZ3Ywc05MTnpiVkNxQ2RYUE4tRWVETDh5enZGVWtNRW9YX3B5S3BIN05sZ2ZxcmJpRXJuSll5eGhxRmRXTjlHc2RLMHV6WXBRcjZrQTZhNUlram84?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;